hence what makes the group cut out `Sp` rather than the symplectic similitude group. -/
theorem anchor_normalization (n : ℕ) (A B : S n × S n × S n → K)
    (h : BlockEquiv (strHn n) (H (K := K) n A) (H (K := K) n B)) :
    ∃ (P Q : ∀ b : Blk, Matrix (BIdx n b) (BIdx n b) K)
      (R : Matrix (Fin (thn n)) (Fin (thn n)) K),
      (∀ b, IsUnit (P b).det) ∧ (∀ s, IsUnit (Q s).det) ∧ IsUnit R.det ∧
      IsBlockDiag (strHn n) R ∧
      P Blk.anch = 1 ∧ Q Blk.anch = 1 ∧ R (k3 n) (k3 n) = 1 ∧
      (∀ k b s, H (K := K) n B k b s
